(Horn \(1981, Proc. IEEE 69\(1\), 14-47\) establishes the third-order weighted finite-difference gradient operator on 3x3 DEM stencils:) Tj
T* (  p = dz/dx = [ \(z20 + 2*z21 + z22\) - \(z00 + 2*z01 + z02\) ] / \(8 * GSD\)) Tj
T* (  q = dz/dy = [ \(z02 + 2*z12 + z22\) - \(z00 + 2*z10 + z20\) ] / \(8 * GSD\)) Tj
T* (  slope_rad = atan\( sqrt\(p^2 + q^2\) \)  ==>  slope_deg = slope_rad * \(180 / pi\)) Tj
T* (The factor 8 in the denominator correctly reflects the sum of stencil kernel weights \(1 + 2 + 1\) * 2*GSD = 8*GSD. Tested against theoretical analytical planes at 0.0) Tj
T* (deg and 10.0 deg: observed error = 0.00000 deg \(Exact Match\).) Tj
