(Propagating LOLA vertical DEM elevation uncertainty \(sigma_z = 1.0 m\) through Horn's stencil with i.i.d. Gaussian errors:) Tj
T* (  sigma_p^2 = sum_i \(dp/dz_i\)^2 * sigma_z^2 = [ 1^2 + 2^2 + 1^2 + \(-1\)^2 + \(-2\)^2 + \(-1\)^2 ] / \(8*GSD\)^2 * sigma_z^2) Tj
T* (            = 12 / \(64 * GSD^2\) * sigma_z^2 = 3 / \(16 * GSD^2\) * sigma_z^2  ==>  sigma_p = [ sqrt\(3\) * sigma_z ] / \(4 * GSD\)) Tj
T* (Because Horn's symmetric weights render Cov\(p, q\) = 0, error propagation to slope S = atan\(sqrt\(p^2 + q^2\)\) yields:) Tj
T* (  sigma_S = sigma_p * cos^2\(S\) = [ sqrt\(3\) * sigma_z / \(4 * GSD\) ] * cos^2\(S\)  \(in radians\)) Tj
T* (At GSD = 59.225m, theoretical sigma_0 = \(sqrt\(3\)*1.0\)/\(4*59.225\) * 180/pi = 0.4189 deg. LunarSafe computed: 0.4189 deg \(0.000%) Tj
T* (error\).) Tj
