(• Symptom: Previous documentation erroneously blamed legacy byte-order / integer decoding misinterpretations for blank) Tj
T* (image outputs.) Tj
T* (• Root Cause: Initial analysis misunderstood 16-bit sensor dynamic range \(~9–455 vs assumed 65,535 full scale\).) Tj
T* (• Repair Applied: Replaced all occurrences across documentation, dossiers, and PDF generators with the true physical) Tj
T* (mechanism:) Tj
T* (  "The bug was a dynamic-range assumption error. The loader divided raw pixel values by 65,535, but the sensor's actual) Tj
T* (dynamic range for this observation was only ~9–455. This crushed all pixels to near-zero, producing a blank image. The fix) Tj
T* (applies a 2-sigma dynamic-range stretch with gamma correction \(gamma = 0.43\), computed from the tile's actual mean and) Tj
T* (standard deviation.") Tj
T* (• Verification: Keyword pattern scan across all files confirmed zero occurrences of prohibited terms in bug context; all 12 PDFs) Tj
T* (regenerated.) Tj
